{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-br300","title":"Buture BR300 Portable Car Battery Jump Starter 1500A","description":"\u003cp\u003eA car battery jump starter can revive a dead battery and keep you moving when you need it most. With a powerful device like the Buture BR300, you can quickly get your vehicle running again, avoiding the hassle and potential danger of being stranded.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eA Powerful Jump Starter\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture BR300 is equipped with a robust 1500 amps peak current, making it one of the best car jump starters available. It is capable of jump-starting 12V vehicles, including cars, SUVs, trucks, and vans with engines up to 7.0L gas or 5.5L diesel. This auto battery jump starter can start your vehicle in seconds, up to 20 times on a single charge. Its high performance ensures that you're never stranded due to a dead battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePortable Charger with Fast Output\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to its jump-starting capabilities, the Buture BR300 also functions as a portable charger. It features fast output USB 1 with 5V\/2.4A, 9V\/2A, and 12V\/1.5A, and USB 2 with 5V\/2.1A, ensuring the fastest charging efficiency for your devices. This means you can charge your smartphone, tablet, or other gadgets up to 4 times faster than with a conventional charger. The jump starter recharges fully in just 4 hours using the included USB C charging cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSafety Protection\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSafety is a top priority with the Buture BR300. It comes with premium cells, circuitry, and safety features that protect you and your device from surges or short circuits. The smart safety jumper cable included with the jump starter ensures safe and foolproof connections, preventing any potential damage or mishaps during use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e4-IN-1 LED Flashlight\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture BR300 isn't just a car jump starter; it's also an essential emergency tool. It includes a built-in LED flashlight with four modes: Lighting, SOS, Strobe, and Warning. Whether you're dealing with a nighttime breakdown or need to signal for help, this versatile flashlight has got you covered.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat You Get\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen you purchase the Buture BR300 Car Jump Starter, you receive a comprehensive package designed to meet all your needs:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eButure BR300 Car Jump Starter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB C Charging Cable (adapter not included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Jumper Clamps\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to 3 Years Warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFriendly Customer Service\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .br300-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .br300-table th, .br300-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .br300-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .br300-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"br300-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1500\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e13800\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (Wh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e51.06\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e7.0L Gas\/5.5L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.3 x 3.0 x 8.8\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e0.44 kg (0.97 lbs)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-4℉~140℉\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 5V\/2A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1: 5V\/2.4A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003cbr\u003eUSB 2: 5V\/2.1A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4 modes: Lighting\/SOS\/Strobe\/Warning\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAccessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSmart Jump Cable x1, Charging Cable x1, User Manual x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492445937919,"sku":"BR300","price":65.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-br300-car-jump-starter.jpg?v=1748254671","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/buture-jump-starter-br300","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}